:''Not to be confused with [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless Enemies]].''
'''Typeless Enemies''' (無色な敵 ''Mushokuna Teki,'' '''Colourless Enemies''') are enemies that fall into no other category, not even [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]]. Currently, only [[Enemy Bases|enemy bases]] belong to this type. All of these enemies are immune to [[Wave Attack|Waves]], Knockback, Freeze, Slow and Weaken.

==Trivia==
*Despite not being bases, [[Nono (Enemy)|Nono]], [[Olga (Enemy)|Olga]], [[Norn (Enemy)|Norn]], [[Yoichi (Enemy)|Yoichi]], [[Aura (Enemy)|Aura]] and [[Healer (Enemy)|Healer]] were originally Typeless instead of [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]]. This seems to have changed in [[Version 6.5 Update|Version 6.5]], [[Version 6.6 Update|6.6]] or [[Version 6.7 Update|6.7]].
*Based on a [https://web.archive.org/web/20141108044602/http://battlecats.spica-net.com/enemy/n.html snapshot] of [https://battlecats-db.com Battle Cats DB] from November 8th, 2014, [[Serum (Enemy)|Serum]], [[Celesse (Enemy)|Celesse]], [[Fuu (Enemy)|Fuu]], [[Rei (Enemy)|Rei]], [[Wyvern (Enemy)|Wyvern]], [[Ghost Doge]], [[Ghost Snache]], [[Ghost Baa Baa]] may have originally been Typeless/[[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]], but changed even earlier than the other non-base Typeless enemies. A [https://web.archive.org/web/20150107183822/http://battlecats.spica-net.com/enemy/n.html later snapshot] from January 7th, 2015, not long after [[Pigeon de Sable]]'s release, suggests that he was also introduced as Typeless/Floating, and in [https://web.archive.org/web/20150223172114/http://battlecats.spica-net.com/enemy/n.html another snapshot] from February 23rd, 2015, [[Monkey King (Enemy)|Monkey King]] and [[SSS Monkey King (Enemy)|SSS Monkey King]] are listed as Typeless rather than Traitless.
*The [[Finale Base (Enemy Base)|Finale Base]] is currently the only base to be [[:Category:Metal Enemies|Metal]] rather than Typeless.

